intervention.tsShape:
Add an ADDITIVE field `intervention` to the object literal returned by buildRunFocusPacket (focus.ts ~line 87-150, as a sibling of `diagnosis`) and to buildSliceFocusPacket (~line 169-215). Shape (plain inline object literal, no new interface, no Zod — RunFocusPacket/SliceFocusPacket are ReturnType aliases at focus.ts:35-36 so the type auto-flows):
intervention: {
  classification: 'valid_artifact_hung_child' | 'schema_failure' | 'missing_result' | 'stale_running_agent' | 'review_blocker' | 'human_verification_failed' | 'retry_budget_pressure' | 'none';
  confidence: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high';
  recommendedAction: 'observe' | 'coach_same_session' | 'reask_structured_result' | 'accept_valid_artifact' | 'revive_same_session' | 'restart_fresh' | 'dispatch_targeted_repair' | 'escalate_human';
  reason: string;
  evidence: string[];   // artifact paths / event ids / escalation ids (run.id, resultPath, eventsPath, escalation entityIds)
  risk: string;
}
For buildSliceFocusPacket, surface intervention from latestRunFocus.intervention when present, else compute slice-level (retry_budget_pressure when retryCount>=5; review_blocker when blocked).
